$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Zeta Hercules I" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Snowing" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midnight" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other for control of Zeta Hercules I, a cold, inhospitable world.  Each team must capture the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base.  There are 2 Rocket Pads that can aid your team and are worth a point each.  The first team with 8 captures shall be the victor!\n\n<f1>Map created by: <f2>[HvC]Mittenman and [HvC]NaTeDoGG\n<f1>http://havoc.sirris.com";
